      "writtenOn": "2026-08-18T14:54:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This matches the pre-6.13 lazy preemption hooks already merged on\n6.6/6.12. Kernel 6.1 has no native lazy preempt, so the deferred\nNEED_RESCHED must be restored when returning to userspace.\nThe hook is a vendor static key. If no vendor module is loaded it\nis a nop (jump label), so default GKI behavior and cost stay\nunchanged. Only our platforms register it.",
